<title>USA: Columbus McKinnon extends Spreckels offer.</title>
<headline>Columbus McKinnon extends Spreckels offer.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.Y. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbus McKinnon Corp said on Thursday it will extend its $24 per share cash tender offer for the acquisition of Spreckels Industries Inc to October 9, 1996 from September 27.</p>
<p>Columbus said that 726,887 shares of Spreckels Class A common stock had been tendered as of September 25.</p>
<p>The company said that 52,690 $1.00 warrants, 183,039 $15.00 warrants, 53,727 $11.67 warrants and no $9.17 Warrants to purchase shares of Class A common stock have been tendered.</p>
<p>Spreckels has about six million common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
